H_0001>的、某个范畴（category）上的函子（functors）构成的范畴（category），因而它自动是一个阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）：序列（sequence）<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>中正合（exact），当且仅当对所有<MATH_0004>，序列（sequence）<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>中正合（exact）。因此，上述复形（complex）在每个次数（degree）上都只是短正合列（short exact sequences）的积（product）。另见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:560547165e6e3e41088c3e7400991d64da452ea0887f3d5e2fec7d03da020fd5", "unit_id": "tag:03OM:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "预层的短正合列。", "source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "预层正合性定义。", "source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"context": "预层的阿贝尔结构。", "source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"context": "预层及函子的范畴。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "取值于阿贝尔群的函子。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "逐点正合的范畴。", "source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"context": "正合性所涉及的序列。", "source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"context": "逐点正合条件。", "source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"context": "上述复形。", "source_term": "complex", "target_term": "复形"}, {"context": "复形的每个次数。", "source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"context": "各次数上的短正合列。", "source_term": "short exact sequences", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"context": "逐次的积。", "source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}, {"context": "引用章名。", "source_term": "Cohomology on Sites", "target_term": "景上的上同调"}]}
